Implemented `--group-by-category` with filtering before grouping, sorted categories, summed quantities, and decimal stock values formatted as JSON strings with two fractional digits.

Processing remains separate from argument parsing. Ungrouped behavior is preserved, invalid CSV returns exit code 2 without a traceback, and README includes a verified example.

All 10 tests passed. Supplied tests were unchanged.
